OL,3,GNEWSACouncil set to scrap plans for new
OL,4,Asports facility
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to improve community
OL,7,Ffacilities in one of Barnsley's most
OL,8,Fdeprived communities looks set to be
OL,9,Fabandoned.
OL,11,FBarnsley Council unveiled plans in
OL,12,FMarch for a new building with modern
OL,13,Fsports changing rooms and a community
OL,14,Fclassroom space at Rabbit Ings Country
OL,15,FPark in Royston.
OL,17,FAt the time, the council was led by
OL,18,FLabour but Reform UK won control in
OL,19,FMay's local elections and is now
OL,20,Flooking at withdrawing funding, saying
OL,21,F"difficult decisions" need to be made
OL,22,Fabout where to spend money.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
